\nWe need to state current recommendation: Candidate D.\n\nProvide evidence: D concentrates well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously (responsibility, technical competence, reliability). Also responds to unexpected events adequately (stress resilience). Mention concerns: know-it-all, moody (crew cooperation). Explain why still best.\n\nAlso compare with others: B has stress and conscientious but weak memory for numbers (attention). C calm but communication issues. A technical but unfriendly.\n\nThus recommendation D.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote D."}
